From 24032d4affc59dec0a11dfa20b3f666d3fb31ce4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 05:50:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat: Link 1.0.6, crash reports, arena cap and CLI-2
 argument check

Box moves from Link 0.4.15 to 1.0.6. It installs Link's crash reports at
start (RT-4; the folder appears with the first report), caps glibc's malloc
arenas before any thread starts (Link D13), and refuses an argument it does
not know with usage on stderr and exit 2 before doing anything (CLI-2).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015owd4wcAhMR1xnKP9qs3Tf
